    LLM: "Winning the first hand is extremely valuable as it 'opens' your first column and gets you closer to opening the second and third.\n\nIf you have a large lead in Game 1 but are trailing in Games 2 and 3, you may play more conservatively to 'lock in' the first game win while trying to gain ground in the others.\n\nManaging the 'knock' timing across multiple game states. If your opponent is close to 100 in Game 1, you might take higher risks to prevent them from taking that specific game bonus.",
